@AI_Investment_Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5143

### Liveness - is the process up?
GET {{AI_Investment_Api_HostAddress}}/health/live
Accept: application/json

### Readiness - is PostgreSQL reachable?
GET {{AI_Investment_Api_HostAddress}}/health/ready
Accept: application/json

### Create a company. Routed through the Action/Policy seam.
### Expect 201 in Development, where ReferenceDataManagement is enabled at risk tier Low.
POST {{AI_Investment_Api_HostAddress}}/api/companies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Microsoft Corporation",
  "ticker": "msft",
  "exchange": "XNAS",
  "sector": "Technology",
  "industry": "Software",
  "country": "US"
}

### Repeat the same request. Expect 409: the idempotency key is already claimed.

### Search by name
GET {{AI_Investment_Api_HostAddress}}/api/companies?q=Microsoft
Accept: application/json

### Search by exact ticker
GET {{AI_Investment_Api_HostAddress}}/api/companies?q=MSFT
Accept: application/json

### Fetch by id - replace with the id returned by the create above
GET {{AI_Investment_Api_HostAddress}}/api/companies/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Accept: application/json

### Kill-switch drill:
###   set AIINV_KILL_SWITCH=1, restart, then POST again. Expect 403 and an audit row
###   recording the denial. Unset it to resume.
